      <div type="clause">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Wal">Wal</ref></head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Walreaf is niðinges dæde: gif hwá ofsacen wille, do þæt mid eahta 7 feowertig fulbórenra þegena.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Robbing the slain is a villianous act; if anyone wishes to deny it, let him do so with [the help of] 48 noble-born thegns.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Wealreaf (id est mortuum refare) est opus niðingi: si quis negare uelit, faciat hoc cum (XLVIII tainis plene nobilibus.</ab>
      </div>
